~ start

if GlobalVars.completed_all_tower
	if GlobalVars.eow_meter > 0.8 
		It's too late to call the repair team.
		=> END
	There's one last thing to fix.
	The repair team is around, they could help you set up the ladder but it might take some time.
	Call the repair team ? 
	- Yes 
		$> MainCommunicator.fadeIn.emit(2)
		$> SoundManager.stop_music.emit()
		$> wait(3)
		You wait for the repair team to arrive. [next=auto]
		$> wait(1)
		...   [next=auto]
		$> wait(2)
		You keep waiting [next=auto]
		$> wait(1)
		They're here. 
		You get to work.

		
		You setup the ladder together.
		$> SoundManager.play_sfx.emit("res://src/Sound/sfx/constructionSound.wav")
		$> wait(5)
		Then they leave.
		Time for a final repair.
		$> MainCommunicator.fadeOut.emit(2)
		$> GlobalVars.eow_meter = GlobalVars.eow_music_trigger - 0.01
		$> SoundManager.reset_music.emit("MainTheme")
		$> SoundManager.change_music.emit("MainTheme")
		$> GlobalVars.playFinalCutscene.emit()
		$> wait(20)
		Do your job now.
		=> END
		
	- No
		=> END
There's a plateform up there with a generator to fix.
You could setup the ladder to climb the tower but that's not something you could do alone.
You'll do that later...
=> END



